# Place AOSP patches here, organised by project subdirectory.
#
# Example layout:
#   patches/aosp/device_brcm_rpi5/0001-car-config.patch
#   patches/aosp/kernel_rpi/0001-driver-fix.patch
#
# Each subdirectory name must match the corresponding project path
# inside rpi5-aosp/ (i.e. the repo checkout directory).
# Patches within each subdirectory are applied in alphabetical order.
